in app/META-INF/licenses/Apache-2.0.txt and in the built APK.

DexKit (org.luckypray:dexkit) and FlatBuffers Java (com.google.flatbuffers)
were bundled previously for a "recommendation-only home" feature and have been
removed, along with their native libdexkit.so binaries. That feature relied on
System.loadLibrary("dexkit"), which inside a hooked host process resolves against
the host app's native library directory and therefore could never load the
module's own copy.
